## ⚠️ CRITICAL MISTAKE #2: Assume user_id NOT NULL

### ❌ WRONG: Direct user_id check
```javascript
// JANGAN LAKUKAN INI!
const [siswa] = await db.execute(
  'SELECT * FROM siswa WHERE user_id = ?',
  [userId]
);
```

### ✅ CORRECT: LEFT JOIN dengan null handling
```javascript
// SELALU GUNAKAN PATTERN INI
const [siswa] = await db.execute(
  `SELECT 
     s.*,
     u.username,
     u.email,
     u.status as user_status,
     k.nama_kelas
   FROM siswa s
   LEFT JOIN users u ON s.user_id = u.id
   LEFT JOIN kelas k ON s.kelas_id = k.id_kelas
   WHERE s.id_siswa = ?`,
  [siswaId]
);

// Check if user exists
if (siswa[0].user_id === null) {
  console.log('Siswa tidak punya akun login');
}
```

### ✅ BEST: With null coalescing
```javascript
const siswaData = siswa[0];
const username = siswaData.username || `siswa_${siswaData.nis}`;
const email = siswaData.email || null;
const hasAccount = siswaData.user_id !== null;
```

