## ⚠️ CRITICAL MISTAKE #3: No Transaction for Multi-Table Ops

### ❌ WRONG: Sequential queries without transaction
```javascript
// JANGAN LAKUKAN INI! (BERBAHAYA)
await db.execute('INSERT INTO users ...', [username, password, 'SISWA']);
const userId = result.insertId;
await db.execute('INSERT INTO siswa ...', [nis, nama, userId]); 
// ☠️ Jika gagal, user sudah masuk tapi siswa tidak!
```

### ✅ CORRECT: Use transaction
```javascript
// SELALU GUNAKAN TRANSACTION
let connection;
try {
  connection = await db.getConnection();
  await connection.beginTransaction();
  
  // 1. Create user
  const [userResult] = await connection.execute(
    'INSERT INTO users (username, password, role, status) VALUES (?, ?, "SISWA", "aktif")',
    [username, hashedPassword]
  );
  
  const userId = userResult.insertId;
  
  // 2. Create siswa
  await connection.execute(
    'INSERT INTO siswa (user_id, nis, nama, kelas_id, status) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, "aktif")',
    [userId, nis, nama, kelasId]
  );
  
  await connection.commit();
  
} catch (error) {
  if (connection) await connection.rollback();
  throw error;
} finally {
  if (connection) connection.release();
}
```

