## ⚠️ CRITICAL MISTAKE #8: Lupa Daily Attendance Logic di Export

### ❌ WRONG: Export per-jam attendance
```javascript
// JANGAN LAKUKAN INI untuk summary reports
const [rows] = await db.execute(
  `SELECT s.nama, ase.status, ase.tanggal
   FROM siswa s
   JOIN absensi_siswa ase ON s.id_siswa = ase.siswa_id
   WHERE ase.tanggal BETWEEN ? AND ?`,
  [startDate, endDate]
);
// ☠️ Akan ada multiple records per siswa per hari!
```

### ✅ CORRECT: Use daily aggregation with priority logic
```javascript
const [rows] = await db.execute(
  `WITH daily_status AS (
      SELECT 
          s.id_siswa,
          s.nama,
          ase.tanggal,
          CASE 
              -- Alpha → Tidak Hadir (highest priority)
              WHEN SUM(CASE WHEN ase.status = 'Alpa' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) > 0 
                  THEN 'Alpa'
              -- Dispen → Hadir (pembelajaran bentuk lain)
              WHEN SUM(CASE WHEN ase.status = 'Dispen' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) = COUNT(*) 
                  THEN 'Dispen'
              -- Izin/Sakit → Hadir dengan status
              WHEN SUM(CASE WHEN ase.status IN ('Izin','Sakit') THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) = COUNT(*) 
                  THEN 'Izin'
              -- Hadir
              WHEN SUM(CASE WHEN ase.status = 'Hadir' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) > 0 
                  THEN 'Hadir'
              ELSE 'Alpa'
          END as status_hari
      FROM siswa s
      LEFT JOIN absensi_siswa ase ON s.id_siswa = ase.siswa_id 
          AND ase.tanggal BETWEEN ? AND ?
      GROUP BY s.id_siswa, s.nama, ase.tanggal
  )
  SELECT 
      nama,
      SUM(CASE WHEN status_hari = 'Hadir' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) as hadir,
      SUM(CASE WHEN status_hari = 'Izin' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) as izin,
      SUM(CASE WHEN status_hari = 'Sakit' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) as sakit,
      SUM(CASE WHEN status_hari = 'Alpa' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) as alpa,
      SUM(CASE WHEN status_hari = 'Dispen' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) as dispen,
      COUNT(DISTINCT tanggal) as total_hari
  FROM daily_status
  WHERE tanggal IS NOT NULL
  GROUP BY nama`,
  [startDate, endDate]
);
```

