## ⚠️ CRITICAL MISTAKE #9: Password Handling

### ❌ WRONG: Plain text password
```javascript
// JANGAN LAKUKAN INI! (SECURITY RISK)
const password = req.body.password;
await db.execute(
  'INSERT INTO users (username, password) VALUES (?, ?)',
  [username, password]
);
```

### ✅ CORRECT: Bcrypt hashing
```javascript
// SELALU HASH PASSWORD dengan bcrypt
const password = req.body.password;
const hashedPassword = await bcrypt.hash(password, 10);

await db.execute(
  'INSERT INTO users (username, password) VALUES (?, ?)',
  [username, hashedPassword]
);
```

### ✅ BEST: With password validation
```javascript
const password = req.body.password;

// Validate password strength
if (password.length < 8) {
  throw new Error('Password minimal 8 karakter');
}

if (!/[A-Z]/.test(password)) {
  throw new Error('Password harus mengandung huruf besar');
}

if (!/[0-9]/.test(password)) {
  throw new Error('Password harus mengandung angka');
}

// Hash password
const hashedPassword = await bcrypt.hash(password, 10);

// Store hashed password
await db.execute(
  'INSERT INTO users (username, password) VALUES (?, ?)',
  [username, hashedPassword]
);
```

