## ⚠️ CRITICAL MISTAKE #10: Duplicate Banding Prevention

### ❌ WRONG: Tidak cek existing banding
```javascript
// JANGAN LAKUKAN INI!
await db.execute(
  'INSERT INTO pengajuan_banding_absen (siswa_id, jadwal_id, tanggal_absen, ...) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ...)',
  [siswaId, jadwalId, tanggalAbsen]
);
// ☠️ Bisa double submit untuk tanggal/jadwal yang sama!
```

### ✅ CORRECT: Check existing banding first
```javascript
// SELALU CEK DUPLICATE DULU
let connection;
try {
  connection = await db.getConnection();
  await connection.beginTransaction();
  
  // Check if banding already exists for this date/schedule
  const [existing] = await connection.execute(
    `SELECT id_banding 
     FROM pengajuan_banding_absen 
     WHERE siswa_id = ? 
       AND jadwal_id = ? 
       AND tanggal_absen = ?
       AND status_banding IN ('pending', 'disetujui')`,
    [siswaId, jadwalId, tanggalAbsen]
  );
  
  if (existing.length > 0) {
    throw new Error('Banding untuk tanggal dan jadwal ini sudah ada');
  }
  
  // Safe to insert
  await connection.execute(
    `INSERT INTO pengajuan_banding_absen 
     (siswa_id, jadwal_id, tanggal_absen, status_asli, status_diajukan, alasan_banding, jenis_banding) 
     VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, 'individual')`,
    [siswaId, jadwalId, tanggalAbsen, statusAsli, statusDiajukan, alasanBanding]
  );
  
  await connection.commit();
  
} catch (error) {
  if (connection) await connection.rollback();
  throw error;
} finally {
  if (connection) connection.release();
}
```

