## 🎯 QUICK CHECKLIST

Sebelum commit code, pastikan:

### Database Operations
- [ ] Gunakan parameterized queries (tidak ada string concatenation)
- [ ] Transaction untuk multi-table operations
- [ ] Validate FK relationships sebelum INSERT
- [ ] LEFT JOIN untuk nullable fields (user_id di siswa)
- [ ] Smart delete (check history sebelum hard delete)

### Multi-Guru Logic
- [ ] Query jadwal menggunakan LEFT JOIN jadwal_guru
- [ ] Include both primary dan additional teachers
- [ ] Check conflict sebelum assign guru tambahan

### Student Management
- [ ] ALWAYS use `siswa` table (bukan `siswa_perwakilan`)
- [ ] Handle nullable `user_id`
- [ ] Auto-create user account saat create siswa
- [ ] Update both users dan siswa dalam transaction

### Security
- [ ] Password di-hash dengan bcrypt
- [ ] JWT token dengan expiration
- [ ] Input validation untuk semua user input
- [ ] Role-based access control di endpoint

### Export & Reports
- [ ] Use daily aggregation logic (bukan per-jam)
- [ ] Priority-based status calculation
- [ ] Fetch letterhead dari system_config
- [ ] Handle empty data gracefully

### Error Handling
- [ ] Try-catch untuk semua async operations
- [ ] Rollback transaction on error
- [ ] Release connection di finally block
- [ ] User-friendly error messages
- [ ] Log errors untuk debugging

